# Mutations for mutate.py. Each one swaps a piece of OrchStoreLock.tla for a
# plausible bug in store.ts and names the one property that must fail on it.
# Every `only` line picks a run that passes on the unmutated spec, so a
# DETECTED line comes from the mutation, not from the expected-FAIL run.

mutation create overwrites an existing lock (line 410 without EEXIST)
detects OneHolder
only noforce hardlink n=2
- /\ IF lock # NoPid
+ /\ IF FALSE

mutation takeOver skips the comparison with the holder (line 485)
detects LockNamesHolder
only noforce hardlink n=3
- /\ Goto(p, IF LockText = holder[p] THEN "unlink" ELSE "unclaim")
+ /\ Goto(p, "unlink")

mutation the sweep removes a live claimant's file (line 459 without holderIsDead)
detects ClaimExclusive
only noforce hardlink n=3
- /\ claimants' = IF c \in dead THEN claimants \ {c} ELSE claimants
+ /\ claimants' = claimants \ {c}

mutation a blocked takeOver keeps its claim (line 475 skipped)
detects NoResidue
only noforce hardlink n=3
- THEN Goto(p, "unclaim") /\ UNCHANGED holder
+ THEN Goto(p, "failed") /\ UNCHANGED holder

mutation rename replaces a claimed takeover directory (line 463 never fails)
detects TakeoverRemovesNamedLock
only noforce hardlink n=3
- /\ IF claimants = {}
+ /\ IF TRUE

mutation an empty lock counts as stale (holderIsDead true for "unknown")
detects TakeoverSparesLiveHolder
only noforce excl n=2
- /\ Goto(p, IF holder[p] \in dead \/ p \in Forcers THEN "mkstaged" ELSE "failed")
+ /\ Goto(p, IF holder[p] \in dead \cup {Unknown} \/ p \in Forcers THEN "mkstaged" ELSE "failed")

mutation every holder counts as stale (line 508 always true)
detects TakeoverSparesLiveHolder
only noforce hardlink n=2
- /\ Goto(p, IF holder[p] \in dead \/ p \in Forcers THEN "mkstaged" ELSE "failed")
+ /\ Goto(p, "mkstaged")

mutation takeOver's lockOrHolder starts with three retries (line 425)
detects TypeOK
only noforce hardlink n=2
- StartCreate(p) == Goto(p, "mkpid") /\ retries' = [retries EXCEPT ![p] = 2]
+ StartCreate(p) == Goto(p, "mkpid") /\ retries' = [retries EXCEPT ![p] = 3]

mutation an ENOENT retry reads again instead of creating (line 425 loop)
detects Terminates
only noforce hardlink n=2
- THEN /\ retries' = [retries EXCEPT ![p] = @ - 1]
-                      /\ Goto(p, "mkpid")
+ THEN /\ retries' = retries
+                      /\ Goto(p, "read")

mutation release waits for the lock instead of unlinking it (line 525)
detects CloseTerminates
only noforce hardlink n=1
- THEN Goto(p, "relunlink") /\ UNCHANGED got
+ THEN Goto(p, "relread") /\ UNCHANGED got

# The release window: the read and unlink of lines 524-525 outside the claim.
mutation release reads and unlinks without a claim (close before this fix)
detects ReleaseRemovesOwnLock
only force one n=2
- /\ Goto(p, "mkstaged")
-             /\ UNCHANGED <<lockfile, claim, temps, holder, retries, seen, got, env>>
+ /\ Goto(p, "relread")
+             /\ UNCHANGED <<lockfile, claim, temps, holder, retries, seen, got, env>>

# The takeover window: a takeover that ignores a release's claim.
mutation a takeover renames over a release's claim (line 463 ignores a releasing claimant)
detects ReleaseRemovesOwnLock
only force one n=2
- /\ IF claimants = {}
+ /\ IF \A q \in claimants: closing[q]

mutation a release refused the claim gives up and leaves its lock (line 533 without the loop)
detects NoResidue
only force one n=2
- THEN IF pc[p] = "busy" THEN "mkstaged" ELSE "released"
+ THEN "released"

mutation the sweep leaves a dead claimant's file (line 460 skipped), release
detects CloseTerminates
only force one n=2
- /\ claimants' = IF c \in dead THEN claimants \ {c} ELSE claimants
+ /\ claimants' = claimants

mutation the sweep leaves a dead claimant's file (line 460 skipped)
detects LateWriterAcquires
only noforce hardlink n=3
- /\ claimants' = IF c \in dead THEN claimants \ {c} ELSE claimants
+ /\ claimants' = claimants

# The assumption that rename replaces an empty directory.
mutation rename cannot replace an empty takeover directory (not POSIX)
detects LateWriterAcquires
only noforce hardlink n=3
- /\ IF claimants = {}
+ /\ IF ~tdir

mutation a crash leaves no dead pid
detects reach:StaleLock
only noforce hardlink n=2
- /\ dead' = dead \cup {p}
+ /\ dead' = dead

mutation the sweep leaves a dead claimant's file (line 460 skipped), reach
detects reach:EmptyTakeoverDir
only noforce hardlink n=3
- /\ claimants' = IF c \in dead THEN claimants \ {c} ELSE claimants
+ /\ claimants' = claimants
